---

No third-party source code is redistributed here. The test data is not mine:

The imagery under `tests/golden/misc/` is a subset of Landsat 8 scene
LC80220492014083LGN00, a work of the U.S. Government in the public domain,
courtesy of the U.S. Geological Survey.

That subset, and the reference region maps under
`tests/golden/*/expected/proof/` that this program is checked against, were
assembled by Chris Holden and taken from https://github.com/ceholden/segment,
the extraction of Jud Harward and Curtis Woodcock's segmentation code from the
IPW library. That repository states no licence terms.

The figures under `docs/img/` are renderings, not data: no NTEMS raster is
redistributed here. The layers they depict are NTEMS products of the Canadian
Forest Service and the University of British Columbia, from
https://opendata.nfis.org/mapserver/nfis-change_eng.html, and the references
NTEMS asks for are listed under Licence in README.md.
